msgstr "aa-structures"

#: checks.py:103
msgid "Audit missing"
msgstr "Аудит отсутствует"

#: checks.py:104
msgid "The character has no corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "У Character нет аудита Character в corptools."

#: checks.py:105
msgid "The player adds this character in the corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "Игрок добавляет этого Character в аудит Character в corptools."

#: checks.py:107
msgid ""
"The player ticks Character Audit in CharLink and logs in with this "
"character."
msgstr "Игрок отмечает Character Audit в CharLink и входит этим Character."

#: checks.py:108
msgid "Tick Character Audit in CharLink and log in with this character."
msgstr "Отметь Character Audit в CharLink и войди этим Character."

#: checks.py:109
msgid "Add this character in the corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "Добавь этого Character в аудит Character в corptools."

#: checks.py:115
msgid "Scopes missing"
msgstr "Не хватает скоупов"

#: checks.py:116
msgid "None of the character's tokens carries all scopes corptools asks for."
msgstr ""
"Ни один из токенов Character не содержит все скоупы, которые требует "
"corptools."

#: checks.py:118
msgid ""
"The player adds this character in the corptools Character Audit again and "
"grants every scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Игрок заново добавляет этого Character в аудит Character в corptools и "
"выдаёт все запрошенные скоупы."

#: checks.py:123
msgid ""
"The player ticks Character Audit in CharLink, logs in with this character "
"again and grants every scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Игрок отмечает Character Audit в CharLink, заново входит этим Character и "
"выдаёт все запрошенные скоупы."

#: checks.py:127
msgid ""
"Tick Character Audit in CharLink, log in with this character again and grant"
" every scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Отметь Character Audit в CharLink, заново войди этим Character и выдай все "
"запрошенные скоупы."

#: checks.py:131
msgid ""
"Add this character in the corptools Character Audit again and grant every "
"scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Заново добавь этого Character в аудит Character в corptools и выдай все "
"запрошенные скоупы."

#: checks.py:139
msgid "Audit inactive"
msgstr "Аудит неактивен"

#: checks.py:140
msgid ""
"corptools marks the audit inactive: a section has not updated for too long."
msgstr ""
"corptools считает аудит неактивным: один из разделов слишком долго не "
"обновлялся."

#: checks.py:141
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, the player adds "
"the character again."
msgstr ""
"Обычно это исчезает после следующего обновления corptools; если нет, игрок "
"заново добавляет Character."

#: checks.py:144
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, the player ticks"
" Character Audit in CharLink and logs in with this character again."
msgstr ""
"Обычно это исчезает после следующего обновления corptools; если нет, игрок "
"отмечает Character Audit в CharLink и заново входит этим Character."

#: checks.py:148
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, tick Character "
"Audit in CharLink and log in with this character again."
msgstr ""
"Обычно это исчезает после следующего обновления corptools; если нет, отметь "
"Character Audit в CharLink и заново войди этим Character."

#: checks.py:151
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, add the "
"character again."
msgstr ""
"Обычно это исчезает после следующего обновления corptools; если нет, заново "
"добавь этого Character."

#: checks.py:157
msgid "Director token missing"
msgstr "Нет токена Director"

#: checks.py:159
msgid ""
"The character is a Director of its Corporation, but none of its tokens "
"carries all scopes corptools needs for the Corporation audit."
msgstr ""
"Character — Director своей Corporation, но ни один из его токенов не "
"содержит все скоупы, нужные corptools для аудита Corporation."

#: checks.py:163
msgid ""
"The Director clicks Add Token in the corptools Corporation Audit, ticks "
"every box and logs in with this character."
msgstr ""
"Director нажимает Add Token в аудите Corporation в corptools, отмечает все "
"флажки и входит этим Character."

#: checks.py:168
msgid ""
"The Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in with this "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Director отмечает Corporation Audit в CharLink и входит этим Character."

#: checks.py:169
msgid "Tick Corporation Audit in CharLink and log in with this character."
msgstr "Отметь Corporation Audit в CharLink и войди этим Character."

#: checks.py:171
msgid ""
"Click Add Token in the corptools Corporation Audit, tick every box and log "
"in with this character."
msgstr ""
"Нажми Add Token в аудите Corporation в corptools, отметь все флажки и войди "
"этим Character."

#: checks.py:182
msgid "Corporation audit missing"
msgstr "Аудит Corporation отсутствует"

#: checks.py:183
msgid "The Corporation has no corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "У Corporation нет аудита Corporation в corptools."

#: checks.py:184
msgid "A Director adds the Corporation in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr ""
"Один из Director добавляет Corporation в аудит Corporation в corptools."

#: checks.py:186 checks.py:196
msgid ""
"A Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in with the Director"
" character."
msgstr ""
"Director отмечает Corporation Audit в CharLink и входит своим Character-"
"Director."

#: checks.py:192
msgid "Corporation token missing"
msgstr "Нет токена Corporation"

#: checks.py:193
msgid ""
"No character of the Corporation has a token with the scopes the Corporation "
"audit needs."
msgstr ""
"Ни у одного Character из Corporation нет токена со скоупами, нужными для "
"аудита Corporation."

#: checks.py:194
msgid ""
"A Director adds a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr ""
"Один из Director добавляет токен Corporation в аудите Corporation в "
"corptools."

#: checks.py:202
msgid "Corporation data stale"
msgstr "Данные Corporation устарели"

#: checks.py:203
msgid "A section of the Corporation audit has not updated within the limit."
msgstr ""
"Один из разделов аудита Corporation не обновлялся в пределах установленного "
"срока."

#: checks.py:205
msgid ""
"A Director checks the Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit "
"and adds a new one if it lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"Один из Director проверяет токен Corporation в аудите Corporation в "
"corptools и добавляет новый, если тот потерял роли."

#: checks.py:210
msgid ""
"A Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in again with the "
"Director character; the old token may have lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"Director отмечает Corporation Audit в CharLink и заново входит своим "
"Character-Director; старый токен мог потерять роли."

#: checks.py:218
msgid "No structure owner"
msgstr "Нет владельца структур"

#: checks.py:219
msgid "The Corporation is not set up as an owner in aa-structures."
msgstr "Corporation не настроена как владелец в aa-structures."

#: checks.py:220
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds the Corporation as an owner "
"in aa-structures."
msgstr ""
"Character с ролью Station Manager добавляет Corporation как владельца в aa-"
"structures."

#: checks.py:222 checks.py:240
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role ticks Structures in CharLink and "
"logs in."
msgstr ""
"Character с ролью Station Manager отмечает Structures в CharLink и входит."

#: checks.py:228
msgid "Structure owner inactive"
msgstr "Владелец структур неактивен"

#: checks.py:229
msgid "The aa-structures owner of the Corporation is switched off."
msgstr "Владелец aa-structures для Corporation отключён."

#: checks.py:230
msgid "An admin switches the owner on again in the aa-structures admin."
msgstr "Администратор снова включает владельца в админке aa-structures."

#: checks.py:236
msgid "No structure owner character"
msgstr "Нет Character владельца структур"

#: checks.py:237
msgid ""
"The aa-structures owner has no enabled character left to fetch data with."
msgstr ""
"У владельца aa-structures не осталось включённого Character для получения "
"данных."

#: checks.py:238
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds itself to the owner in aa-"
"structures."
msgstr ""
"Character с ролью Station Manager добавляет себя к владельцу в aa-"
"structures."

#: checks.py:246
msgid "Structure sync failing"
msgstr "Синхронизация структур не удаётся"

#: checks.py:247
msgid "aa-structures reports a sync that is not up to date."
msgstr "aa-structures сообщает о синхронизации, которая не актуальна."

#: checks.py:248
msgid ""
"Check the owner in aa-structures: its characters may have lost the Station "
"Manager role."
msgstr ""
"Проверьте владельца в aa-structures: его Character могли потерять роль "
"Station Manager."

#: checks.py:251
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role ticks Structures in CharLink and "
"logs in again; the owner's characters may have lost the role."
msgstr ""
"Character с ролью Station Manager отмечает Structures в CharLink и заново "
"входит; Character владельца могли потерять эту роль."

